## Meal Plan (Week of Nov 17)

1. **Sheet-pan lemon-herb chicken + broccoli + sweet potato** — easy, big leftovers potential
2. **Salmon with roasted cherry tomatoes & white beans over arugula** — 25 min, very veg-forward
3. **Greek-style turkey meatballs with cucumber-tomato salad & whole wheat pita** — uses pantry staples
4. **Shrimp & veggie stir-fry with brown rice** — fast, ~20 min
5. **Chickpea & spinach stew with lemon and feta** — vegetarian night, makes good leftovers for lunch

Portioned for 1, but a couple recipes (#1 and #5) will give you an extra lunch.

